      "summary": "| Period IV  | Zombie Era: Edmund industrializes zombie pits; economy shifts to thrall labor. |",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Chronological Designation:</strong> Period III: The Magical Capital</p>\n  <p><strong>Core Theme:</strong> Desecration of <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/ancillus-i\">Ancillus</a>, Earthquake, & First Undead</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Historical Chronicle</h3>\n<p>| Period IV  | Zombie Era: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/edmund\">Edmund</a> industrializes zombie pits; economy shifts to thrall labor.      |</p>\n<p>| Period V   | <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/daedalus\">Mad King Daedalus</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/obsidian-blade\">Obsidian Blade</a> found; city sacrificed; Starfall meteor strikes.    |</p>\n<p>| Period VI  | Religious Rulership: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/fergus\">Fergus</a>'s crusade; Fountain found; child crucifixion; coup/murder. |</p>\n\n",
