      "summary": "Last human member of Daedalus's King's Guard (Period V) and Founder of the Church of Nemeth (Period VI).",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Historical Role:</strong> Last human member of Daedalus's King's Guard (Period V) and Founder of the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/church-of-nemeth\">Church of Nemeth</a> (Period VI).</p>\n  <p><strong>Period of Prominence:</strong> Period V</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Canonical Actions</h3>\n<p>Recovered the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/obsidian-blade\">Obsidian Blade</a> and promised to restore Zingara as the magical capital of the world. Instead, he unleashed a zombie army upon <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/kordava\">Kordava</a>, sacrificing his entire capital to fuel a ritual for personal godhood. When the Starfall meteor disrupted his ritual, his cosmic lover, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/tanatos\">Tanatos</a>, trapped him in eternal, conscious imprisonment beneath the city rubble for boring her.</p>\n<h3>Lasting Legacy on Modern Zingara</h3>\n<p>Lies buried alive in the rubble beneath <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/the-pit\">The Pit</a>, still holding the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/obsidian-blade\">Obsidian Blade</a> and bound to his cosmic punishment.</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/fergus\">Fergus</a></p>\n\n",
