      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Historical Role:</strong> Cosmic Incarnation of Death and lover of <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/daedalus\">King Daedalus</a> (Period V).</p>\n  <p><strong>Period of Prominence:</strong> Period V</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Canonical Actions</h3>\n<p>Present at the dawn of the city sacrifice in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/kordava\">Kordava</a>, completely checked out and indifferent to mortal bloodletting. Following the Starfall meteor strike, she personally condemned <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/daedalus\">Daedalus</a> to eternal conscious imprisonment beneath the earth because his megalomania proved tedious and boring.</p>\n<h3>Lasting Legacy on Modern Zingara</h3>\n<p>A lingering, terrifying cosmic presence in Zingaran lore, symbolizing the absolute, inescapable end of all things.</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/falmouth\">Falmouth</a></p>\n\n",
