      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Underwater Ancient Tomb</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Holds pre-Cataclysmic Thurian weaponry, ancient armor, and the dormant <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/final-guard\">Final Guard</a>.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Flooded vertical shafts, aquatic ghoul constructs, 1,000 animate stone guardians.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/final-guard\">The Final Guard</a>: Kalenius's mausoleum is permanently guarded by the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/final-guard\">Final Guard</a>—one thousand elite ancient Thurian warriors transformed into deathless, animate stone.</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Flooded vertical shafts, aquatic ghoul constructs, 1,000 animate stone guardians.</p>\n</div>\n",
