      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Fertile River Basin</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Agriculture, wine, olive oil, horse breeding.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Republican guerrillas, hidden church shrines, local bandits.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p>Attributes: Fertile river basin, agricultural spine, ancestral estates.</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Republican guerrillas, hidden church shrines, local bandits.</p>\n</div>\n",
