      "summary": "Island Chain / Reef Corridor. Maritime trade lanes, privateer hideouts.",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Island Chain / Reef Corridor</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Maritime trade lanes, privateer hideouts.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Barachan pirates, naval blockades, sudden sea storms.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p>Forest of Ghouls: A primeval, gloom-draped wilderness in southeastern Zingara near the Rabirian border. Avoided by commoners and knights alike, this superstitious forest conceals the ancient, cursed City of the Ghouls, where feral necromantic constructs, rogue ghouls, and forgotten cults wander through overgrown marble ruins.</p>\n<p>4.4 Borderlands & Regional Neighbors</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Barachan pirates, naval blockades, sudden sea storms.</p>\n</div>\n",
