      "summary": "Republican Insurgents in The Pit hold evidence that General Don Rodorigo and Marquis Murzio arranged the murder of a republican founder in Period VI and framed the Church of Nemeth.",
      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/republican-insurgents\">Republican Insurgents</a> in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/the-pit\">The Pit</a> hold evidence that General <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valenza\">Don Rodorigo</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/sadoria\">Marquis Murzio</a> arranged the murder of a republican founder in Period VI and framed the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/church-of-nemeth\">Church of Nemeth</a>. Rebel intermediaries seek pardons and reforms; church agents want the evidence published. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Council</a> assassins are hunting the informants. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/judith\">Judith</a>'s attempted assassination has complicated any approach from the rebels: her membership is established, but who authorized her ambush remains unknown. This evidence concerns a different crime from Androvo's Period VII dispatch at <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/san-severo\">San Severo</a>.</p>",
