      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p>A collapsed industrial zombie pit near <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/jerida\">Jerida</a> has released memory-retaining thralls into an iron mine. A reanimated Period IV scholar leads them and knows a passage toward the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/black-blade\">Black Blade of Azur</a>. The thralls seek refuge in the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/pictish-wilderness\">Pictish Wilderness</a>. The <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Restoration Council</a> is withholding household funds over the lost revenue, while <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vane\">Master Alchemist Vane</a> seeks to recover the workers. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/royal-university-of-kordava\">The Royal University of Kordava</a>'s interest in independent necromantic research threatens his monopoly. Toxic slurry continues to seep into the abandoned workings.</p>",
