      "summary": "Vesper the Key-Master possesses a map to the submerged tomb of King Kalenius.",
      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vesper\">Vesper the Key-Master</a> possesses a map to the submerged tomb of King Kalenius. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#relics/final-guard\">The Final Guard</a> remains beneath the ruins. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/white-rose-command\">Mordermi</a> of the White Rose has separately located a sealed doorway in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/the-pit\">The Pit</a> and holds a bronze key; he is preparing to awaken the guardians in response to an army assault. These overlapping interests draw rival expeditions toward the same ancient legacy without establishing that either route is safe.</p>",
