      "summary": "Vesper is studying the Restoration Council's subterranean treasury and its guarded access routes.",
      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vesper\">Vesper</a> is studying the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Restoration Council</a>'s subterranean treasury and its guarded access routes. The <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Council</a> conceals reserves while announcing royal bankruptcy. Sadoria's clerks are scrutinizing missing receipts, and the Night Guild has its own interest in the movement of coin beneath <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/kordava\">Kordava</a>. This vault is separate from the grain aboard the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/argossean-grain-fleet\">Argossean Grain Fleet</a> and from the attic trove used in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/judith\">Judith</a>'s ambush.</p><h3>Current development: the palace-treasure bargain</h3><p>The players have met <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/beltran-desoto\">Beltrano</a>, who agreed to fence palace treasure on condition that they kill <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/savarro-the-caulk\">Savarro the Caulker</a>. The Velascan assassin is killing local thieves as part of the existing dock war. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-palace-silver-bargain\">The agreement remains pending</a>.</p>",
