      "summary": "Current faction activity and unresolved campaign pressures.",
      "content": "<h3>Current campaign pressures</h3><ul><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-blood-in-cauldron\">Blood in the Cauldron</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/foreign-powers\">Argos</a> demands the signet ring of an ambassador murdered during <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#history/daedalus\">Mad King Daedalus</a>&#x27;s reign.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-insurgents-bargain\">The Insurgent&#x27;s Bargain</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/republican-insurgents\">Republican Insurgents</a> in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/the-pit\">The Pit</a> hold evidence that General <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valenza\">Don Rodorigo</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/sadoria\">Marquis Murzio</a> arranged the murder of a republican founder in Period VI and framed the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/church-of-nemeth\">Church of Nemeth</a>.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-pits-of-edmund\">The Reeking Pits of Edmund</a>: A collapsed industrial zombie pit near <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/jerida\">Jerida</a> has released memory-retaining thralls into an iron mine.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-fallen-shrine\">Waters of the Fallen Shrine</a>: The <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Restoration Council</a> maintains access to a magical wasting poison and uses dependence on antidotes to control its allies.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-concealed-order\">The Concealed Execution Order</a>: General <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valenza\">Don Rodorigo</a> is circulating an execution order disguised as a mobilization against a rebel encampment in the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/zingg-valley\">Zingg Valley</a>.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-treasury-lockout\">The Treasury Lockout</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/sadoria\">Marquis Murzio</a> controls the crown ledgers and withholds money for an independent city watch, citing debts to <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/foreign-powers\">Argos</a>.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-tax-revolt-jerida\">The Tax Revolt of Jerida</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/gonzalo-guarralid\">Duke Gonzalgo</a>&#x27;s garrison in <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/jerida\">Jerida</a> is seizing royal timber and ore barges on the Thunder River.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-tomb-kalenius\">The Tomb of King Kalenius</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vesper\">Vesper the Key-Master</a> possesses a map to the submerged tomb of King Kalenius.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-treasury-heist\">The Treasury Heist</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vesper\">Vesper</a> is studying the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/restoration-council\">Restoration Council</a>&#x27;s subterranean treasury and its guarded access routes.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-grain-fleet-heist\">The Gilded Sheaf: The Great Grain Heist</a>: The <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/argossean-grain-fleet\">Argossean Grain Fleet</a> waits offshore with 50,000 bushels of grain.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-the-necromancers-endowment\">The Necromancer&#x27;s Endowment: Reclaiming the Sunken Spire</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/royal-university-of-kordava\">The Royal University of Kordava</a> seeks an endowment of 500 gold sovereigns.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-the-dissolute-baron\">The Dissolute Baron: The Tin Lode Gambit</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/tristan-revella\">Don Tristao de Revello</a>&#x27;s proposed reinstatement has drawn competing claims to <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/revella\">Revella</a>.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-uprising-san-severo\">The Executioner&#x27;s Crown: The Uprising at San Severo</a>: General <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valenza\">Don Rodorigo</a> has brought two hundred troops to <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/san-severo\">San Severo del Vado</a> and prepared warrants against <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/andres-hojeda\">Androvo de Ojedo</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/madre-soledad\">Madre Soledor</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/alcalde-cadenas\">Alcalde Barzolo Kadenzo</a>.</li><li><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-the-deserters-testimony\">The Deserter&#x27;s Confession: Rodorigo&#x27;s Blood-Stained Ledger</a>: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/andres-hojeda\">Androvo de Ojedo</a> holds Rodorigo&#x27;s original Period VII Dispatch of the Black River, ordering the murder of thirty church peace emissaries and the planting of republican pamphlets.</li></ul><p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/judith\">Judith</a>’s attic ambush has already occurred; she has left the palace. Other unresolved situations do not imply a predetermined player response or outcome.</p><h3><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#hooks/hook-palace-silver-bargain\">Palace Silver and the Dockside Murders</a></h3><p>The players have met Beltrano, who agreed to fence palace treasure if they kill Savarro, the Velascan assassin killing local thieves. The bargain remains unfulfilled.</p>",
