      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p>The <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/argossean-grain-fleet\">Argossean Grain Fleet</a> waits offshore with 50,000 bushels of grain. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/nikolos-voros\">Nikolos Voros</a> commands the ships while <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/demetrio-phokas\">Demetrio Phokas</a> protects their creditors' claims. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/tiberio\">Ambassador Tiberio</a> is pressing the court over the debt; Sadoria uses the shortage to reinforce his control of spending. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/kordovan-thieves-guild\">The Night Guild</a> and the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/velasco\">Velasco</a> Syndicate watch the cargo and compete over harbor intelligence. Dockworkers are exchanging grain tallies on scraps of sailcloth as rumors of preferential unloading spread.</p>",
