      "summary": "The Royal University of Kordava seeks an endowment of 500 gold sovereigns.",
      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/royal-university-of-kordava\">The Royal University of Kordava</a> seeks an endowment of 500 gold sovereigns. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/dean-baltasar-argote\">Dean Balthaso de Argoto</a> is pursuing patrons while <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valeria-morata\">Maestra Valessa de Morato</a> develops labor and combat thralls outside <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/vane\">Master Alchemist Vane</a>'s monopoly. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/eusebio-falcon\">Eusevios Falkor</a> studies the sunken Period III academy beneath the campus. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/revella\">Revella</a>'s tin is valuable to the university's galvanic work, but its ownership and supply remain contested. Students have begun keeping duplicate research notes in separate lodgings after laboratory papers disappeared.</p>",
