      "summary": "General Don Rodorigo has brought two hundred troops to San Severo del Vado and prepared warrants against Androvo de Ojedo, Madre Soledor, and Alcalde Barzolo Kadenzo.",
      "content": "<h3>Current situation</h3><p>General <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/valenza\">Don Rodorigo</a> has brought two hundred troops to <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/san-severo\">San Severo del Vado</a> and prepared warrants against <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/andres-hojeda\">Androvo de Ojedo</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/madre-soledad\">Madre Soledor</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#npcs/alcalde-cadenas\">Alcalde Barzolo Kadenzo</a>. <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/hermandad-de-las-espinas\">La Hermandad de las Espinas</a> holds the bridge and shelters refugees while refusing grain seizures. Rodorigo wants an assault and summary executions; Androvo's possession of the Dispatch of the Black River gives him a private reason for urgency. Soledor's message has reached <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/velasco\">Velasco</a>, whose armed river contingent is approaching. The assault is being prepared for dawn; the relief force's actual arrival depends on river conditions. Neither a battle nor a settlement has yet been established.</p>",
