      "summary": "A former palace maid and republican rebel who lured the rulers into an undead ambush and has since left the palace.",
      "content": "<h3>The attic ambush — established events</h3><p>Judith was a maid in the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#gazetteer/palace-of-kordava\">High Alcázar of Kordava</a>. She attempted to assassinate the players by leading them to a hidden trove in an attic. She left before an undead beast ambushed them. Judith has now left the palace.</p><h3>Allegiance and unanswered questions</h3><p>Judith belongs to the <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"#factions/republican-insurgents\">Republican Insurgents</a>. Her present whereabouts, the source of the undead beast, and whether anyone in the White Rose leadership authorized her attempt remain unknown.</p>",
      "gmSecrets": "",
